- M. Abadi et al. (2016). "TensorFlow: a system for large-scale machine learning". *OSDI*, 265–283.
- H. V. Henderson and P. F. Velleman (1981). "Building multiple regression models interactively". *Biometrics* 37(2), 391–411. doi:10.2307/2530428 (Source of the `mtcars` data.)
